ts}$ events by ${\\approx}1\\%$ at high jet and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson $p_{\\mathrm{T}}$ regions compared to those of ${\\mathup{{{Z}}}}\\hskip-2.5pt+\\hskip-1.49994pt\\text{jets}$ events. An uncertainty of 1.5% is included in the R(c/j) and R(b/j) differential results for jet ( $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson) $p_{\\mathrm{T}}$ bins where $p_{\\mathrm{T}}>60$ (90)  GeV .\"],\n  \"answer\": \"The text mentions that the efficiencies tend to be lower for ${\\mathup{{{Z}}}}\\hskip-2.5pt+\\hskip-1.49994pt\\text{HF~jets}$ events by ${\\approx}1\\%$ at high jet and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson $p_{\\mathrm{T}}$ regions"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-10", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Results + Summary + Appendix A Post-fit $M_{\\text{SV}}$ distributions in the exclusive jet $p_{\\mathrm{T}}$ bins", "window": 8, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text does not mention the signal efficiency of the pT^miss < 40 GeV cut.\", \"quotes\": [], \"answer\": \"\", \"found\": false}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-10", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Results + Summary + Appendix A Post-fit $M_{\\text{SV}}$ distributions in the exclusive jet $p_{\\mathrm{T}}$ bins", "window": 8, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\n  \"reasoning\": \"The text does not mention signal efficiency or the pT^miss < 40 GeV cut.\",\n  \"quotes\": [],\n  \"answer\": \"\",\n  \"found\": false\n}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-10", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Results + Summary + Appendix A Post-fit $M_{\\text{SV}}$ distributions in the exclusive jet $p_{\\mathrm{T}}$ bins", "window": 8, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\n  \"reasoning\": \"The question asks for the signal efficiency of the pT^miss