en by minimizing the reconstructed and nominal mass of the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson (top quark). From this optimization, the $\\mathup{{{c}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ jet candidates from top quark and $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson decays are identified. The event is kept if these candidates pass the jet HF tagging requirement described in Section 4 .\",\n    \"In the resulting sample of the $\\mathup{{{c}}}$ jet candidates about half have correct flavor assignment whereas the other half constitute mostly $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ jets that are misidentified as $\\mathup{{{c}}}$ jets.\",\n    \"The scale factors obtained from the combined fit in the inclusive ${\\mathup{{{Z}}}}\\hskip-2.5pt+\\hskip-1.49994pt\\text{HF~jets}$ data sample are $\\text{SF}_{\\text{c}}=0.849\\pm 0.013\\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.064\\text{ (syst)}$ and $\\text{SF}_{\\text{b}}=0.873\\pm 0.005\\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.013\\text{ (syst)}$ .\"\n  ],\n  \"answer\": \"The text mentions the performance of the b-tagging algorithm, indicating that about half of the $\\mathup{{{c}}}$ jet candidates have correct flavor assignment, while the"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-11", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Estimation of the event yields", "window": 4, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\n  \"reasoning\": \"The text does not mention the b-tagging algorithm, working point, or performance.\",\n  \"quotes\": [],\n  \"answer\": \"\",\n  \"found\": false\n}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-11", "answer": true, "quote": "The jet HF tagging requirement described in Section 4.", "quote_verified": true, "quotes": ["The jet HF tagging requirement described in Section 4.", "The scale factors obtained from the combined fit in the inclusive ${\\mathup{{{Z}}}}\\hskip-2.5pt+\\hskip-1.49994pt\text{HF~jets}$ data sample are $\text{SF}_{\text{c}}=0.849\\pm 0.013\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.064\text{ (syst)}$ and $\text{SF}_{\text{b}}=0.873\\pm 0.005\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.013\text{ (syst)}$."], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "The text mentions a 'jet HF tagging requirement' but does not specify the algorithm or working point. It does provide scale factors for c and b jets, which are performance metrics: $\text{SF}_{\text{c}}=0.849\\pm 0.013\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.064\text{ (syst)}$ and $\text{SF}_{\text{b}}=0.873\\pm 0.005\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.013\text{ (syst)}$.", "section": "Estimation of the event yields", "window": 4, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text mentions b-tagging and HF tagging, which are related to b-tagging algorithms, but it does not specify the exact algorithm or working point used. It does mention performance in terms of scale factors and uncertainties.\", \"quotes\": [\"The jet HF tagging requirement described in Section 4.\", \"The scale factors obtained from the combined fit in the inclusive ${\\mathup{{{Z}}}}\\hskip-2.5pt+\\hskip-1.49994pt\\text{HF~jets}$ data sample are $\\text{SF}_{\\text{c}}=0.849\\pm 0.013\\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.064\\text{ (syst)}$ and $\\text{SF}_{\\text{b}}=0.873\\pm 0.005\\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.013\\text{ (syst)}$.\"], \"answer\": \"The text mentions a 'jet HF tagging requirement' but does not specify the algorithm or working point. It does provide scale factors for c and b jets, which are performance metrics: $\\text{SF}_{\\text{c}}=0.849\\pm 0.013\\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.064\\text{ (syst)}$ and $\\text{SF}_{\\text{b}}=0.873\\pm 0.005\\text{ (stat)}\\pm 0.013\\text{ (syst)}$.\", \"found\": true}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-11", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Estimation of the event yields", "window": 5, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"This text does not mention any b-tagging algorithm, working point, or performance.\", \"quotes\": [], \"answer\": \"\", \"found\": false}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-11",